        {
          "id": "d-2.1",
          "claim": "The covariance supplier constructs the strongly continuous unitary Fock lift and exact test pullback. The explicit rotation matrix and pi-shift theorem give S_R(2\u03c0)=-I_4; substituting x=\u03c0 into the pi-shift identities gives cos(2\u03c0)=1 and sin(2\u03c0)=0, hence S_R(4\u03c0)=I_4. The test pullbacks are -F and F, and field antilinearity gives the field sign. The same supplier gives invariant vacuum, cyclic global field algebra, and the Fock 2\u03c0/4\u03c0 actions.",
