        "notes": "Independently read current Statement, Facts and Proof 1.1\u20133.1, all eight direct suppliers, and operative scalar-causal and fermionic translation proofs. CAR-locality yields zero cross anticommutators, including adjoints; rs swaps give +1 for even monomials, including degree zero. Covariance supplier uses separately invariant positive/negative kernel pairings, dense test-generated ranges and antisymmetric tensor lifts; its global vacuum cyclicity proof subtracts lower-degree CAR contractions and makes no local cyclicity claim. Explicit half-angle matrices give -I at 2pi and I at 4pi using exact pi-shift values; the n=0 sector is fixed and odd/even sectors have (-1)^n. Translation multipliers sum future vectors and positive omega for both species. At mu=0 omega is positive almost everywhere, so the zero-energy eigenspace is the vacuum line despite no positive gap; for mu>0 nonvacuum energy is at least mu. Evolution is translation by -ct, consistent with H_SI=hbar c K_D on its maximal domain and gap m_rest c squared. No empirical inputs or general spin-statistics assertion. Reader/refuter contain no findings; upstream readiness holds are preserved, not certified by this consumer review."
